config TOUCHSCREEN_FOCALTECH_RODIN
	tristate "FocalTech touch driver for rodin"
	depends on TOUCHSCREEN_XIAOMI_TOUCH_RODIN
	default n
	help
	  FocalTech thp touch IC driver (focaltech_touch_rodin) built-in port.
	  SPI bus binding: compatible "xiaomi,touch-spi"; on rodin the
	  focaltech IC (FT5672) wins the probe race on this unit.
